---------------------------------------- KEY ATTESTATION GUIDE ----------------------------------------

1. "km_keybox_attestation" should be located on /data/vendor

2. keybox.xml file should be also located on /data/vendor

3. Execute binary like this:
	./binary <xmlfile> <deviceNumber>
	ex) ./km_keybox_attestation keybox.xml 3

The criteria for device number are order.
The first device ID in the xml file is 1.
If the number of device IDs is N, the last device ID is N.

4. Then, you can check keybox_sample.so in mnt/vendor/persist
This path is pre-defined in our code, So If you want to change path, execute like this
	./binary <xmlfile> <deviceNumber> <path>
	ex) ./km_keybox_attestation keybox.xml 3 /data/vendor/

5. If you want to check key provisioning,
	./km_keybox_attestation -check <path>
	<path> is option. default path is /mnt/vendor/persist/keybox_sample.so
	1) "OK" : It has no problem
	2) "ERROR" : It has problem. you can see log through logcat.
	ex) ./km_keybox_attestation -check /data/vendor/keybox_sample.so

6. After execute "km_keybox_attestation",
	1) "OK" : It has no problem
	2) " "(nothing print) : It has problem. you can see log through logcat.

7. You can also excute through adb shell
	ex) adb shell km_keybox_attestation -check
	ex) adb shell km_keybox_attestation <xmlfile> <deviceNumber>
